1
00:00:00,140 --> 00:00:01,900
(Transcribed by TurboScribe. Go Unlimited to remove this message.) Pat found a bunny.

2
00:00:02,520 --> 00:00:04,560
She found it on the street.

3
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:07,080
There was blood on the bunny.

4
00:00:07,740 --> 00:00:09,840
It looked like it was in pain.

5
00:00:10,780 --> 00:00:13,100
Pat did not want to leave it alone.

6
00:00:14,100 --> 00:00:15,500
She carried it home.

7
00:00:16,120 --> 00:00:18,280
She put it in a shoebox.

8
00:00:18,940 --> 00:00:21,540
She asked her mom if she could keep

9
00:00:21,540 --> 00:00:21,780
it.

10
00:00:22,620 --> 00:00:24,400
Her mom said no.

11
00:00:25,020 --> 00:00:26,820
The bunny might have rabies.

12
00:00:27,800 --> 00:00:30,540
Pat took the bunny to the veterinarian.

13
00:00:31,100 --> 00:00:33,780
The bunny probably could not live.

14
00:00:34,900 --> 00:00:36,300
It was too injured.

15
00:00:37,520 --> 00:00:39,860
Pat asked her mom again if she could

16
00:00:39,860 --> 00:00:40,460
keep it.

17
00:00:41,100 --> 00:00:43,200
She said that the bunny would die in

18
00:00:43,200 --> 00:00:43,680
a week.

19
00:00:44,540 --> 00:00:45,720
Her mom said okay.

20
00:00:46,660 --> 00:00:49,200
Pat took really good care of the bunny.
